# --- On-device ML models --------------------------------------------------
# Regenerable 45 MB+ binaries, kept out of git. Every change would store another
# full copy, and the model can be rebuilt from the recipe in the README.
# Its absence is a supported state: the app still detects, aligns and boxes
# faces, and says recognition is unavailable.
*.tflite
*.tflite.bak
